         // his soul fires and the King's rods, the Elder Warden's forgot the shared six - so the
         // check plants one entry of *every* kind of rigging (including kinds the Elder Warden has
         // no business having) and requires the door to clear all of them. A door that stops going
         // through the one teardown fails here with the leftover named.
